// ApiKeyScope - `conversations:read`: list, get and count conversations; list messages; attachments,
//
//		message e-mail and raw source; list labels and canned replies.
//	  - `conversations:write`: create, update (status, assignee, snooze, priority, labels), move
//	    and bulk-update conversations.
//	  - `messages:write`: outgoing and incoming messages, drafts: create, edit, discard; for
//	    OAuth tokens also replies to reader threads and their accepted answer.
//	  - `drafts:send`: send a draft (`POST /v1/messages/{id}/send`), together with
//	    `messages:write`.
//	  - `notes:write`: notes.
//	  - `contacts:read`: list, look up and get contacts, presence.
//	  - `contacts:write`: create, update, delete and merge contacts.
//	  - `inboxes:read`: workspace, members, inboxes, inbox members, channels.
//	  - `inboxes:manage`: create, update and delete inboxes and channels, inbox access, secret
//	    and key rotation.
//	  - `labels:write`: create, update and delete labels.
//	  - `canned_replies:write`: create, update and delete canned replies.
//	  - `webhooks:manage`: webhooks, their deliveries and attempts.
//	  - `workspace:manage`: update the workspace, usage; for an owner's OAuth token also asking
//	    the operator to allow broadcasts.
//	  - `feedback:write`: feedback.
//	  - `lists:read`: mailing lists, subscriptions, growth, consent exports.
//	  - `lists:write`: create, change and delete lists; add, unsubscribe and delete
//	    subscribers; resend confirmations.
//	  - `broadcasts:read`: broadcasts, their audience counts, reviews and reports; e-mail
//	    designs, their snapshots and renders, images, the template gallery. Deliveries also
//	    need `contacts:read`.
//	  - `broadcasts:write`: create, change and delete draft broadcasts and send tests; create,
//	    save, copy, archive and restore designs; upload and delete images.
//	  - `broadcasts:send`: schedule, unschedule, pause, resume and cancel broadcasts. Scheduling
//	    and resuming also need the workspace's `broadcasts.by_keys`. Never implied: a key made
//	    without naming its scopes does not hold it.
//	  - `migrations:manage`: detect, create, change, connect, test and delete migrations into
//	    Yuva. Owners and admins only; never offered to agents' tokens, refused for keys limited
//	    to inboxes.
//	  - `analytics:read`: analytics properties.
//	  - `analytics:write`: server-side analytics events; for API keys only, never offered to
//	    OAuth clients.
//	  - `analytics:manage`: create, change and delete analytics properties, rotate their keys,
//	    delete their data. Never offered to agents' tokens, refused for keys limited to inboxes.
//	  - `status:read`: status pages, their groups, components and incidents.
//	  - `status:manage`: set component states, open, change and resolve incidents and their
//	    updates; create, change and delete pages, groups and components (owners and admins).
//	    Never implied: a key made without naming its scopes does not hold it.
//	  - `help:read`: help centers, their collections, articles, translations, revisions,
//	    previews, search and report.
//	  - `help:write`: create and change collections and articles, save, restore and delete draft
//	    translations, render Markdown, upload images.
//	  - `help:publish`: create, configure and delete help centers; publish and unpublish
//	    translations, delete published ones. API keys only, and never implied: a key made without
//	    naming its scopes does not hold it, and OAuth clients are not offered it.
//
//	  - `roadmap:read`: roadmap boards, an idea's stage history and linked counts.
//	  - `roadmap:write`: link feedback to ideas, "Reply to linked" for ideas, create, change and
//	    delete boards (owners and admins).
//	  - `roadmap:stage`: move an idea's stage, which sets the progress of its linked feedback.
//	    Never implied: a key made without naming its scopes does not hold it.
//
//	  - `changelog:read`: What's new changelogs and their entries.
//	  - `changelog:write`: write entries and translations, save drafts, upload images, render Markdown.
//	    Mailing an entry to subscribers also needs `broadcasts:write` and `lists:read`.
//	  - `changelog:publish`: create, configure and delete changelogs; publish, schedule, unschedule
//	    and unpublish entries, change or delete published ones. API keys only, and never implied:
//	    a key made without naming its scopes does not hold it, and OAuth clients are not offered it.
//
//	  - `audit:read`: the workspace's audit log. Only an owner gives it to a key, and only to a key
//	    without an inbox limit; offered only to owners' OAuth tokens. Never implied: a key made
//	    without naming its scopes does not hold it.
//
// `lists:*`, `broadcasts:*`, `migrations:manage`, `analytics:*`, `status:*`, `help:*`, `roadmap:*`, `changelog:*` and `audit:read` are never added to keys made before they existed.
type ApiKeyScope string

